      "description": "A black-and-white photo showing a man and a woman standing side by side, smiling, with the man holding a tiger cub. The woman is wearing a pearl necklace and a light-colored coat, while the man is in a dark suit. The tiger cub is positioned in front of the man, looking toward the camera. The scene appears staged and cheerful, likely from the 1960s or 1970s.",
