      "instance_name": "1960s_cultural_context",
      "label": "1960s Cultural Context",
      "description": "The black-and-white photo style, clothing (pearl necklace, suit), and the staged nature of the photo suggest a 1960s or 1970s setting. This requires background knowledge of mid-20th century fashion, photography, and social norms to understand the visual tone and potential historical context. The meme may be referencing a specific era's aesthetic or cultural attitudes toward religion, animals, or public displays of wealth or exoticism.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
