      "label": "Religious Prophecy Mockery",
      "description": "The meme uses the juxtaposition of a tiger cub (symbolizing wildness and chaos) with the text 'we are all apart of god's plan. christ will come to us' to satirize or mock religious prophecies about divine intervention or the Second Coming. This is considered harmful as it trivializes or undermines religious beliefs, which are often held with reverence and seriousness by believers, potentially causing offense or disrespect.",
